			"Message": "fix(Project): Align webview.setHtml channel between Mountain and Sky\n\nSynchronized submodule update fixing webview-view extension API communication:\n\n1. Mountain adds suffix mapping to translate VS Code's camelCase `webview.setHtml` to Sky's canonical kebab-case `set-html` channel. This ensures events route correctly to `sky://webview/set-html` where Sky's listener expects them.\n\n2. Sky adds two new handlers completing the webview-view lifecycle:\n   - `sky://webview/set-html` - applies HTML to parked workbench WebviewView from `__CEL_WEBVIEW_VIEWS__`\n   - `sky://webview/postMessage` - forwards extension messages to the parked view's webview\n\nThis is the final piece of the channel alignment series (following Terminal, Debug, StatusBar, Progress, Output), enabling extensions like GitLens to properly render their sidebar panels.",
			"SHA": "271252d910f0d1a555fcf6b7ea42d4acaf909fc4"
		},
